/*
 * Historical content of "Africa Carved Up" — English translation of js/history.js.
 * Keep it in step with the Catalan original: same keys, years, powers and note ids.
 * Only the texts change. build/check_i18n.py checks that the structure matches.
 *
 * Criteria (see js/history.js):
 *  - Each timeline row is [year, power, name at the time, [notes]].
 *  - The year is that of the formal claim (treaty, protectorate, proclamation) over most of the
 *    present-day territory. Until then the country is marked "PRE" and the 1880 map shows below.
 *  - Death tolls are estimates; where sources diverge a range and a note are given.
 */
