    lso: "British protectorate from 1868; administered by the Cape Colony between 1871 and 1884.",
    com: "Mayotte had been French since 1841; the rest of the archipelago became a protectorate in 1886 and was annexed in 1912. Mayotte remains French, despite UN resolutions.",
