    bwa: "Bechuanaland Protectorate, proclaimed in March 1885.",
    uga: "Protectorate over Buganda in 1894, extended to the rest of the territory from 1896.",
    mli: "Ségou fell in 1890 and the Toucouleur Empire in 1893; Timbuktu was occupied in 1894. Between 1904 and 1920 the colony was called Upper Senegal and Niger.",
