    herero: "Estimates vary: some 60,000–65,000 Herero victims (out of a population of about 80,000) and some 10,000 Nama. In May 2021 Germany recognised it as genocide \"from today's perspective\" and offered €1.1 billion in development aid, which many Herero and Nama representatives have rejected as insufficient and not negotiated with them. Sources: H. Drechsler, <i>Let Us Die Fighting</i> (1966); D. Olusoga and C. Erichsen, <i>The Kaiser's Holocaust</i> (2010).",
